/.review-pr*/

# What `cargo test` needs in a checkout and a release does not ship from here.
# The desktop shells are templates: `pnpm build:studio-desktop` stages a copy
# elsewhere and generates these into it. Producing them in place is the way to
# compile the Rust tests locally, and none of it is source.
tools/*-shell/frontend/
tools/*-shell/src-tauri/icons/
